        { title: 'Logical order', body: 'dependencies are already oriented, but no physical duration is measured yet.' },
        { title: 'Internal scale', body: 'the metric gives weight to small reading steps in depth μ.' },
        { title: 'Timelike sign', body: 'the sign opposite to spatial lengths prevents μ from being merely a fourth distance.' },
